### ==============================================================================
### SISTEMA PREDICTIVO DE MANTENIMIENTO VEHICULAR - PETICIONES HTTP / REST CLIENT
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Health Check del Backend, Motor ONNX y Módulo de Seguridad JWT
GET http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MÓDULO 1: AUTENTICACIÓN Y ROLES (RBAC)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Registro de Conductor (ROLE_DRIVER) con vehículo inicial
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Carlos Conductor",
  "email": "carlos.driver@veloce.com",
  "password": "driverPassword123",
  "phone": "+57 300 123 4567",
  "role": "ROLE_DRIVER",
  "licensePlate": "TRX-720",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Hilux Turbo-Diesel",
  "modelYear": 2023,
  "baseMileageKm": 64820.0
}

### 3. Registro de Mecánico (ROLE_MECHANIC)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ing. Mateo Celli",
  "email": "mateo.mechanic@veloce.com",
  "password": "mechanicPassword123",
  "phone": "+57 311 987 6543",
  "role": "ROLE_MECHANIC"
}

### 4. Login Conductor Preconfigurado (Retorna Token JWT)
# @name loginDriver
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "driver@veloce.com",
  "password": "driver123"
}

### 5. Login Mecánico Preconfigurado (Retorna Token JWT)
# @name loginMechanic
POST http://localhost:8082/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mecanico@veloce.com",
  "password": "mecanico123"
}

### 6. Perfil del Usuario Autenticado (/api/auth/me)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriver.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MÓDULO 2: DIAGNÓSTICO PREDICTIVO VEHICULAR (PROTEGIDO)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Diagnóstico Vehicular - Conductor Reporta Falla en su Vehículo TRX-720
POST http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/diagnose
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriver.response.body.token}}

{
  "licensePlate": "TRX-720",
  "mileageKm": 64820.0,
  "kmSinceLastService": 8450.0,
  "fuelConsumptionRatio": 1.12,
  "rawSymptomText": "Noticeable rattle and high vibration when accelerating over 60 km/h, accompanied by intermittent transmission slip"
}

### 8. Intento de Conductor Diagnosticando Vehículo Ajeno (RBAC Error 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/diagnose
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriver.response.body.token}}

{
  "licensePlate": "FORBIDDEN-999",
  "mileageKm": 120000.0,
  "kmSinceLastService": 14000.0,
  "fuelConsumptionRatio": 1.15,
  "rawSymptomText": "Falla en caja de cambios"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MÓDULO 3: HISTORIALES Y REGLAS RBAC
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 9. Conductor Consulta Historial de su Placa Asignada TRX-720 (Permitido)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/history/TRX-720
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriver.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Conductor Intenta Consultar Placa no Asignada (403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/history/MTR-505
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriver.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Mecánico Consulta Historial de Cualquier Placa (Permitido)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/history/TRX-720
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMechanic.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Mecánico Consulta Historial Global Completo de Toda la Flota (ROLE_MECHANIC)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/history
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMechanic.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Conductor Consulta sus Vehículos Asignados
GET http://localhost:8082/api/vehicles/my-vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriver.response.body.token}}
Accept: application/json
